     "title": "★★SAT_RULE 2 的余量：**次主模取根**（根因已定位）",
     "deviation_literal": "主模逐 ky 精确（2.4e-12 / 4.1e-12 / 2.7e-14）；次主模 tglf07 4.0e-2、tglf09 1.0；tglf09 mode-2 增长率 ky[0] 上游 0.72876 对本仓 0.04359",
     "verdict": "inconclusive",
     "caveat": [
